### Grounded Document Assistant (Agentic RAG)

#### `.gitignore`
```gitignore
# Byte-compiled / optimized files
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# Virtual Environment
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# Environment Secrets (CRITICAL: Do NOT push API keys)
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# IDE & Editor files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Ingested large test files
*.pdf
